---
manual: art.stroke
lines: [1839, 1847]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: E5
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  stroke red
  arrow 0, 100, 10
end
----------- test code
# The manual's arrow: 10 px wide, centred on (0, 100) (E5), so half of it is off the window.
# Its 1 px outline blends with white at the edges; look for a reddish pixel there.
around = (0..6).to_a.product((94..106).to_a).map { |x, y| pixel_at(x, y).first(3) }
reddish = around.any? { |r, g, b| r > 150 && g < 170 && b < 170 && r > g + 60 }
assert reddish, "the arrow has a red line around it"
